Package: com.r0gueee.theosstudio
Name: TheosStudio
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Maintainer: r0gueee <r0gueee@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Recommends: theos
Description: Build Theos tweaks on the device
 Projects, a Logos editor, and a build, package and install pipeline driven by
 the Theos the device already has.
 .
 TheosStudio does not ship a compiler: it runs the make, clang, ldid and
 dpkg-deb that the jailbreak already has, shows their output, lifts the
 compiler's errors and warnings out of the log, and installs the .deb the build
 produces. The Toolchain tab names anything that is missing and the command that
 installs it.
 .
 Packages install to /var/jb/Applications on a rootless jailbreak and to
 /Applications on a rootful one.
Homepage: https://github.com/R0GUEEE/TheosStudio
